nked final browser test build. Follow the in-game controls; Esc pauses.","Browser","disclosure",[237],{"_60":238,"_27":239,"_106":-7},"Read the AI usage and representative prompts","https://github.com/Ponloe/dunkirk-godot#ai-usage",[241,242,243],"Play the final test build and inspect movement, shooting, scoring, and pause.","Read the AI usage table and representative prompts.","Compare the source scenes and scripts with the generated backdrop and credited external assets.","The creator credits Gemini for backdrop generation and ideation, ChatGPT for planning and debugging, and Claude for small code suggestions. The developer manually integrated and tested the work.","Godot 4.6 · GDScript",[241,242,243],{"_60":238,"_27":239,"_19":235},{"_60":232,"_27":203,"_19":229,"_106":233},{"_60":219,"_27":220,"_106":221,"_168":169},{"_60":214,"_27":215,"_106":216},[166,167],[253],{"_254":226,"_27":227,"_19":117,"_106":255},"platform","Author-provided Dunkirk.exe and a separate ZIP attachment. The Windows executable is downloadable; its signing, dependencies and launch behavior were not tested. The ZIP contents were not inspected.","resource:godot-command-line","resource","Godot's official CLI reference for headless operation, script checks, asset import, execution, and export.","/resources/",{"_21":167,"_317":96,"_148":318,"_56":319,"_316":258,"_311":310,"_27":308,"_300":320,"_294":321,"_290":322,"_286":285},[263,264,265,266,267,268,269,270,271,272,273,274],"website/src/data/resources.json",{"_56":23,"_69":96,"_58":317,"_93":-7},{"_56":157,"_69":258,"_58":316,"_93":-7},{"_56":66,"_60":314,"_69":315,"_58":148,"_93":153},{"_56":66,"_60":312,"_69":313,"_58":56,"_93":153},{"_56":66,"_60":309,"_69":310,"_58":311,"_93":145},{"_56":57,"_60":110,"_62":306,"_58":27,"_93":-7},{"_56":85,"_60":298,"_136":288,"_62":299,"_58":300,"_93":-7},{"_56":85,"_60":292,"_136":288,"_62":293,"_58":294,"_93":-7},{"_56":85,"_60":287,"_136":288,"_62":289,"_58":290,"_93":-7},{"_56":66,"_60":284,"_69":285,"_5